    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "sFx9n",
      "x": 1303.8012958963282,
      "y": -287.5,
      "name": "Note C",
      "width": 560,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "DIRECTION C — Decision-First Mission Control\nThe bot's state machine and circuit breakers are the hero: a full-width state band + breaker tiles answer 'is it safe?' in one glance, then the dominant region is the decision log — the narrative of why the bot did or didn't trade (the spec's core audit promise, and the view that stays interesting during the long no-trade stretches). Sharp, technical, paper-toned."
    },
