      "name": "Note B",
      "width": 560,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "DIRECTION B — Dark Trading Terminal\nBloomberg/TradingView-dense single screen: everything visible at once, mono numerals, panel grid, bottom quote ticker. Safety state lives in a persistent top status strip (state, breakers, data age, API budget, stop mode). For an owner who wants market-desk energy and maximum information density."
